DESCRIPTION
Unit test for the oslat subpackage of the rt-tests package.
Runs oslat command for a specified duration and optionally
checks if latency exceeds the maximum threshold.

STEPS TO RUN
[LATCHECK={0|1} MAXLAT={latency_threshold} RUN_TIME={duration}] bash ./runtest.sh
  Note: RUN_TIME must be significantly less than the max_time defined in metadata

SUPPORTED PLATFORMS
all

KNOWN ISSUES
none
